1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Have you noticed your two-month-old looking right at you?

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,500
Two months is when they start looking back.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:12,000
Faces become the most interesting thing in the room.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,700
And yours is the favourite.

5
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:20,600
Smile at them, talk to them — some babies will smile back.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:23,600
Listen for sounds that aren't crying.

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,700
A grumble. A small vowel.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Make the sound back, then wait.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,600
Often, they go again.

10
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Some do this at six weeks.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,600
Some nearer three months.

12
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,600
Both are ordinary.

13
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,900
Say something back.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,400
Save this for the week it happens.

